-- A furnished lounge: the furniture library on show. Metres; east is on your right when you face north.
create a room called lagos-lounge, 5.2 by 4.2, 2.8 high.
make the floor oak.
paint the walls #d9cfbf.

cut a window in the north wall, 1.8 wide, 1.6 high, sill 0.7, at 2.9.
cut a door in the south wall, 0.9 wide, 2.1 high, at 4.4, in walnut.
hang curtains on the north window, in linen.

place a sofa against the west wall, at 2.3, 2.2 long, 0.9 deep, in green velvet.
place a coffee table in front of the sofa, 0.42 away, 1.0 by 0.6, in walnut.
lay a rug under the coffee table, 3.0 by 2.2, in terracotta.
place an armchair facing the sofa, at 3.75 2.3, in #e69d27.
place a side table at 4.5 2.95, in oak.
place a floor lamp at 0.35 3.65, in linen.
place a bookshelf against the east wall, at 1.0, 1.2 long, in oak.
place a plant at 4.75 3.8, 1.5 high.
hang art on the west wall, 1.0 by 0.7, at 2.3, 1.55 high, in navy.
hang a pendant over the coffee table, 2.0 high.

photograph the room called overview, from 4.7 0.45 1.3, looking at 1.4 3.0 1.0, 24 mm.
photograph the sofa corner, from 3.3 1.0 1.15, looking at 0.6 2.6 0.7, 28 mm.
photograph the reading nook called window-wall, from 2.6 0.6 1.3, looking at 2.6 4.2 1.2, 28 mm.
photograph the bookshelf, from 2.6 1.6 1.25, looking at 5.0 0.9 1.0, 35 mm.

-- presentation presets: no coordinates needed
photograph the north wall.
photograph the north-west corner.
photograph the armchair, close.
photograph the plant, close, portrait.

-- a 360 view from the middle of the room
take a panorama at 2.6 1.6 called centre.

-- walk-through: in at the door, round the coffee table, to the window
walk from the door through 2.8 1.5 to the window, called arrival, 8 seconds.
